+## Legacy pipe-delimited export
+
+`export/legacy.py` writes the pre-2025 pipe-delimited format. It is no longer part of
+the CLI or the `export` package's public API. The only caller is the nightly job in
+`deploy/crontab` that writes `/srv/out/finance.txt` for the old finance importer.
+
+It is retained because that importer has not been confirmed migrated. To remove it,
+confirm nothing reads `/srv/out/finance.txt`, then delete `export/legacy.py`,
+`tests/test_legacy.py`, and the crontab line in one change.
